Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back and have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a dark theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug War
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story about a child spending his summer vacation at his grandfather's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a stronger bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna catch him, doesn't it have to be at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Night...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't let me leave the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder which bug will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's sure to be a great match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The adults hold special insect sumo matches at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see, I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see, I want to see, I want to see, I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back last year's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.45,0:01:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:01:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Step right up, to the bug arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of money at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that brat over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't what we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.11,0:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyou...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,i didn't mean to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was still too soon for you. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you saw it. Well, it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Next year's insect sumo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The end
